    {
      "id": 15409783111838,
      "title": "PANTHER DISCOVERY SET",
      "handle": "panther-discovery-set",
      "body_html": "<p>The Panther Collection Discovery Set brings together all five DOMANI parfums in 2 ml vials, presented in a slide box marked with the panther's gaze.</p>\n<p>It is the simplest way to meet the house: wear each scent on your own skin, through a full day, and discover which one feels like you.</p>\n<p>What's inside</p>\n<p>ALBORI · Sweet &amp; Gourmand<br>Pear, pink pepper, coffee, vanilla, patchouli.</p>\n<p>AZZURO · Fresh &amp; Aquatic<br>Peppermint, lavender, sea water, neroli, sandalwood.</p>\n<p>INIZIO · Warm, Spicy &amp; Sweet<br>Green cardamom, toffee, amberwood, bourbon vanilla.</p>\n<p>VELORA · Amber &amp; Woody<br>Saffron, jasmine, amberwood, ambergris, cedar.</p>\n<p>OBSIDIAN · Leather &amp; Smoky<br>Cardamom, black leather, jasmine sambac, amber, patchouli.</p>\n<p>5 × 2 ml / 5 × 0.06 fl. oz. Parfum.<br>A considered gift, and the perfect travel companion.</p>",
