      "title": "ALBORI",
      "handle": "albori",
      "body_html": "<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Sweet, smooth and softly spiced. Albori begins with the brightness of pear and the gentle warmth of pink pepper over orange blossom. At its heart, roasted coffee and bitter almond meet jasmine and a hint of licorice, before vanilla, patchouli and cashmere wood leave a creamy trail.</p>",
